==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[skemmta]]'' meaning "to [[entertain]]" and ''[[sér#Icelandic|sér]]'' the {{dat}} of ''[[sig#Icelandic|sig]]'' meaning "[[oneself]]".

===Verb===
'''[[skemmta]] [[sig#Icelandic|sér]]'''

# to [[entertain]] [[oneself]], to [[have fun]]
#: ''Heyrðu.. Reyndu allavegana að '''skemmta þér''', okei?''
#:: Listen.. At least try to '''have fun''', OK?

====Derived terms====
* [[skemmta sér konunglega]]

